{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...No thoughts, just head empty and decorate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >so... what to do?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > you can customize and freely expand/resize most furniture~</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > change both weather and time to affect the atmosphere of your diorama~</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > most furniture is interactable (and squishable...)~ </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > custom furniture (drag and drop sprites into the game...)~ </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > invite friends to help you decorate your diorama (this game is not guaranteed to actually ship with friends but i'm working on it.....)~</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > pop bubble wrap~</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > there are no beds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > other stuff...? (there are around 1000 decorative pieces or so; despite the obvious decor counter, i\u2019m not actually able to count this high yet so i\u2019m just guessing really\u2026.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>seriously though, this is just yet another decorating game so all you do is place stuff meaning you should keep your expectations low; but i still hope that you ultimately end up liking diorama since I put a lot of work into it!!</i>~</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >controls... but what do they do?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WASD / arrow keys</strong> - move around your diorama</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>left mouse button</strong> - place furniture anywhere you like</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>right mouse button </strong> - customize most furniture by changing their colour</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>middle mouse button </strong> - copy any selected furniture (surprisingly, this might be the most underused button in most games...)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>R</strong> - flip/mirror furniture (useful for non-symmetric furniture...)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>F</strong> - search for furniture by typing names or keywords</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>E</strong> - hide the interface</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u02da \u0f18\u2661 \u22c6\uff61\u02da \u2740</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Another Home","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2887460/74b64bf30c0806a5761f297903a92237ac17aa83.jpg"},{"name":"A Short Break","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2887460/e4b849beaf2452b750aa1645e9b659831d39b39f.jpg"}],"total":2},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2887460?t=1770245840","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887460/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770245840","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887460/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770245840","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887460/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770245840","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...No thoughts, just head empty and decorate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >so... what to do?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > you can customize and freely expand/r